76	     *  today) — the person's own in force on that day, else those of the grade they had that day in force on it, else the sheet's. The claim
77	     *  keeps them, so its due-by can be worked out again when a holiday is added (see ClaimRepository#refixDueBys). */
78	    public static int terms(Person person, SettingRepository settings) {
